1
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:12,890
[Kim Seonghyuk as Kwon Hyukjae]

2
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:16,180
[Jung Myeongcheol as Yoo Sehyun]

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,880
[Jung Hyunwoong as Kim Minho]

4
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,080
[Kim Hyeonseo as Sung Ho]

5
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,460
[Sin and Love]

6
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,140
[Episode 9]

7
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,280
Yoo Sehyun,

8
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,320
you're under arrest on suspicion of
illegal drug dealing at Gangnam Palace.

9
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,450
Please come with me.

10
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,440
Who authorized this?

11
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:50,880
Someone reported you

12
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,780
for illegal drug dealing.

13
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:56,000
Who reported it?

14
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,930
It was an anonymous tip.

15
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,700
We've secured the evidence.

16
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:06,050
I didn't do it!

17
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:10,039
This case is under investigation.

18
00:01:10,550 --> 00:01:13,680
What you're doing constitutes
obstruction of justice.

19
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:18,880
I didn't do it.

20
00:01:22,210 --> 00:01:23,340
Please come with me.

21
00:01:24,270 --> 00:01:24,770
Sehyun.

22
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,539
You'll be fine.

23
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,220
Go with him.

24
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:41,650
Let's go.

25
00:02:04,990 --> 00:02:07,790
[Officer Kwon Hyukjae: Sung Ho, the
drug dealing suspicion against Yoo Sehyun]

26
00:02:07,790 --> 00:02:08,990
[has been confirmed, huh?]

27
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,079
I've been assigned to interrogate you.

28
00:03:31,579 --> 00:03:32,360
Do you have

29
00:03:34,150 --> 00:03:35,350
anything to confess?

30
00:03:42,650 --> 00:03:44,050
You feel like a stranger.

31
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,250
What do you mean?

32
00:03:49,390 --> 00:03:51,150
We were together a second ago,

33
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,500
and now you want me to confess?

34
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,940
That was then; this is now.

35
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:11,890
I missed you.

36
00:04:16,610 --> 00:04:18,470
We've only been apart for an hour.

37
00:04:20,470 --> 00:04:21,209
Even so,

38
00:04:22,370 --> 00:04:24,410
this hour has been hell for me.

39
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:29,900
Let's not talk about personal matters.

40
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,480
Then come closer.

41
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,610
I'll tell you the truth.

42
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:51,070
Now's not the time for that.

43
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:53,380
Why?

44
00:04:54,780 --> 00:04:56,180
Isn't this what you want?

45
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,680
The door's locked

46
00:04:59,780 --> 00:05:00,980
and the camera's off.

47
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,350
Isn't this what you want?

48
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,880
You're a suspect,

49
00:05:07,580 --> 00:05:08,680
and I'm a cop.

50
00:05:11,650 --> 00:05:12,150
So?

51
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:15,760
You don't want to do it?

52
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:27,850
You're playing with fire.

53
00:05:33,330 --> 00:05:33,850
I know.

54
00:05:36,290 --> 00:05:38,020
If you really are a drug dealer,

55
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:42,340
listening to you makes me an accomplice.

56
00:05:44,390 --> 00:05:45,520
You know it's not me.

57
00:05:46,670 --> 00:05:48,200
But they don't believe you.

58
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:49,470
It's Kwon Hyukjae.

59
00:05:49,470 --> 00:05:50,470
Do you have proof?

60
00:05:56,310 --> 00:05:58,040
All the evidence points to you.

61
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:01,980
At Gangnam Palace, you were his sidekick.

62
00:06:01,980 --> 00:06:04,220
Do you know about
the trading locations and such?

63
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:05,080
I need details.

64
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:08,870
No, nothing.

65
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:13,380
I was in charge of accounting
at Gangnam Palace,

66
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:16,650
but I don't know who he dealed with.

67
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:20,580
And every time he made a call,
he'd avoid me.

68
00:06:21,820 --> 00:06:22,850
Even during transactions,

69
00:06:22,850 --> 00:06:24,380
I was just on the sidelines.

70
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:26,540
Sung Ho.

71
00:06:28,310 --> 00:06:29,510
That's why I need you.

72
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:31,940
Please help me.

73
00:06:33,290 --> 00:06:34,090
How can I help?

74
00:06:37,900 --> 00:06:38,760
Before that...

75
00:06:41,909 --> 00:06:43,320
I really want to kiss you.

76
00:07:08,810 --> 00:07:09,270
Sung Ho!

77
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:10,550
Wait.

78
00:07:15,730 --> 00:07:17,060
Leave everything to me.

79
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:29,780
Now, you'll

80
00:08:30,850 --> 00:08:32,179
begin your confession.

81
00:08:36,549 --> 00:08:37,880
We're doing this again?

82
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:40,380
Fine, let's do this.

83
00:08:43,659 --> 00:08:45,590
How did Kwon Hyukjae communicate?

84
00:08:46,210 --> 00:08:48,140
Let's start with his phone number.

85
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:51,480
I don't know how he communicated,

86
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:55,260
but he used a different number
every time he called.

87
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,660
What about the transactions?

88
00:09:00,650 --> 00:09:02,010
Cash or bank transfers?

89
00:09:03,250 --> 00:09:04,250
Account numbers?

90
00:09:06,210 --> 00:09:07,470
I don't know anything.

91
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,610
Because he never told me anything.

92
00:09:12,330 --> 00:09:14,990
I was only in charge
of the palace's accounting.

93
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:16,980
The incoming money

94
00:09:18,180 --> 00:09:19,480
were all laundered.

95
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:24,080
Then...

96
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:29,700
do you know
where the transactions took place?

97
00:09:32,380 --> 00:09:33,980
I don't, but...

98
00:09:37,810 --> 00:09:38,870
Assemblyman Jo...

99
00:09:39,430 --> 00:09:41,360
He mentioned Assemblyman Jo once.

100
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:44,680
Assemblyman Jo?

101
00:09:46,410 --> 00:09:47,870
The Assemblyman Jo I know?

102
00:09:49,770 --> 00:09:50,570
That's right,

103
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,530
the presidential candidate Jo Kanghoon.

104
00:09:53,930 --> 00:09:55,190
Kwon Hyukjae once said

105
00:09:56,350 --> 00:09:58,410
that Assemblyman Jo is the real boss,

106
00:09:59,090 --> 00:09:59,820
and he's just

107
00:10:00,710 --> 00:10:02,180
working under him.

108
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,200
Then...

109
00:10:09,310 --> 00:10:10,640
can you testify to that?

110
00:10:13,260 --> 00:10:13,710
Me?

111
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,400
Of course not.

112
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,380
I have no proof.

113
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:23,180
I didn't record him saying that.

114
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:26,870
If I create an opportunity for you,

115
00:10:28,050 --> 00:10:29,150
can you record it?

116
00:10:31,690 --> 00:10:32,580
I'm afraid not.

117
00:10:34,270 --> 00:10:37,000
Kwon Hyukjae wouldn't
say things like that to me.

118
00:10:37,170 --> 00:10:40,030
He only mentioned Assemblyman Jo
when he was drunk.

119
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:47,450
Right.

120
00:10:51,650 --> 00:10:53,780
So I'll create an opportunity for you.

121
00:10:54,650 --> 00:10:55,280
How?

122
00:10:57,220 --> 00:10:58,510
I'll get you out first.

123
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:10,870
I'll be waiting.

124
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:15,510
Okay.

125
00:12:25,780 --> 00:12:27,840
You take charge of Yoo Sehyun's case.

126
00:12:28,450 --> 00:12:28,980
Yes, sir.

127
00:12:32,190 --> 00:12:33,290
Did Sung Ho tell you to

128
00:12:33,290 --> 00:12:34,620
look out for Yoo Sehyun?

129
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:37,050
Not yet.

130
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,780
He'll come to you for Yoo Sehyun.

131
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:45,500
When he does,

132
00:12:45,500 --> 00:12:46,500
report to me ASAP.

133
00:12:49,260 --> 00:12:50,260
What if Sung Ho...

134
00:12:52,550 --> 00:12:54,210
finds evidence against you?

135
00:12:58,140 --> 00:12:59,000
Let him find it.

136
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:02,750
But only what I deliberately prepared.

137
00:13:06,590 --> 00:13:07,190
You've got

138
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,780
everything planned out, huh?

139
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:12,980
If I couldn't handle things like this,

140
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:14,510
I wouldn't be where I am now.

141
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:21,230
Go check out Yoo Sehyun.

142
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:23,510
We need him alive.

143
00:13:26,650 --> 00:13:27,180
Yes, sir.

144
00:13:58,930 --> 00:13:59,730
Yoo Sehyun,

145
00:13:59,900 --> 00:14:00,960
you have a visitor.

146
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,560
Sehyun, it's me.

147
00:14:16,450 --> 00:14:17,380
Why are you here?

148
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:22,110
To see how you're doing.

149
00:14:23,850 --> 00:14:25,310
I bought you what you like.

150
00:14:29,110 --> 00:14:30,680
After doing this to me,

151
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:33,480
what's the use of anything else?

152
00:14:47,370 --> 00:14:48,570
Yes, I did this to you,

153
00:14:49,210 --> 00:14:51,410
and all the evidence points to you.

154
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:53,850
What?

155
00:14:55,950 --> 00:14:57,610
Sehyun, what I want is Sung Ho.

156
00:14:59,210 --> 00:15:00,510
I want him to stop looking into

157
00:15:00,510 --> 00:15:01,310
this case.

158
00:15:02,490 --> 00:15:04,420
That's what I've been waiting for.

159
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,380
Find someone else.

160
00:15:10,650 --> 00:15:11,850
I can't help you.

161
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:36,050
How many times must I tell you

162
00:15:36,050 --> 00:15:37,380
you don't have a choice?

163
00:15:40,450 --> 00:15:41,650
Either you do as I say,

164
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:45,110
or you can keep rotting in here.

165
00:15:46,980 --> 00:15:47,890
It's up to you.

166
00:15:49,950 --> 00:15:51,010
What's in it for me?

167
00:15:52,210 --> 00:15:52,670
Sung Ho?

168
00:16:24,550 --> 00:16:25,020
Sung Ho.

169
00:16:27,020 --> 00:16:28,100
Stop looking into

170
00:16:28,910 --> 00:16:29,860
Yoo Sehyun's case.

171
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:31,190
It won't do you any good.

172
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:34,910
Seriously?

173
00:16:36,310 --> 00:16:37,770
After you made the arrest?

174
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:40,750
It's an order.

175
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:43,220
An order?

176
00:16:45,710 --> 00:16:46,480
Whose order?

177
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:48,900
Kwon Hyukjae's?

178
00:16:54,580 --> 00:16:56,450
What did you say when you shot him?

179
00:16:59,160 --> 00:17:01,690
You said you didn't want to
be his dog anymore.

180
00:17:03,450 --> 00:17:04,510
So what's this now?

181
00:17:08,150 --> 00:17:09,880
You're being his lackey again.

182
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,800
You don't understand...

183
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:15,349
I do.

184
00:17:19,450 --> 00:17:20,849
You're working for him.

185
00:17:23,609 --> 00:17:24,470
I'm scared too.

186
00:17:25,670 --> 00:17:26,480
But...

187
00:17:29,650 --> 00:17:31,510
Fear is no excuse for compromise.

188
00:17:33,790 --> 00:17:34,450
Give me...

189
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:38,450
a bit more time.

190
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:43,780
Time won't wait for you.

191
00:17:45,050 --> 00:17:46,510
You have to fight for it.

192
00:19:06,530 --> 00:19:07,790
Did you get some sleep?

193
00:19:10,150 --> 00:19:11,050
Not really.

194
00:19:12,910 --> 00:19:15,170
I've been thinking about how to save you.

195
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,050
Did you

196
00:19:19,510 --> 00:19:20,770
figure something out?

197
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:26,160
No.

198
00:19:32,390 --> 00:19:33,500
I'm so worried.

199
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:38,310
You look worse than yesterday.

200
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:44,700
Sung Ho,

201
00:19:46,450 --> 00:19:47,180
it's okay.

202
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:50,180
We could just give up.

203
00:19:53,910 --> 00:19:54,530
You are

204
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:57,880
more shaken than yesterday.

205
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:01,890
It's all because of you.

206
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,250
Sung Ho.

207
00:20:32,210 --> 00:20:33,450
If I can't get out,

208
00:20:35,010 --> 00:20:36,140
will you wait for me?

209
00:20:39,140 --> 00:20:39,980
Yeah.

210
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:43,980
Whether it's 10 or 20 years,

211
00:20:45,950 --> 00:20:46,980
I'll wait for you.

212
00:20:54,310 --> 00:20:55,310
Don't wait for me.

213
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:58,580
If I can't get out,

214
00:21:00,410 --> 00:21:03,270
I want you to find someone else
and live a happy life.

215
00:21:16,350 --> 00:21:16,850
No.

216
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,340
You're the only one for me.

217
00:21:28,030 --> 00:21:29,490
I promise I'll get you out.

218
00:21:32,550 --> 00:21:34,010
No matter what happens...

219
00:21:36,650 --> 00:21:37,850
I will make you happy.

220
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:47,430
No matter what...

221
00:21:50,110 --> 00:21:51,810
I'll find a way to get you out.

222
00:21:54,840 --> 00:21:55,940
I'll save you.

223
00:22:01,990 --> 00:22:02,450
Got it?

224
00:22:36,540 --> 00:22:38,780
[Sin and Love]
